        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:machine#e-a4e0d5416f88a26b",
          "text": "Though many companies use algorithms (算法) to weed out fake reviews, Azimi points out that the machines are programmed by humans, and given our limited ability to spot fake reviews, this isn’t a good sign.",
