        {
          "exampleId": "w:machine#e-85a4724a4cb30c69",
          "text": "Huawei’s Pangu-Weather, Nvidia’s FourcastNet, and Google DeepMind’s GraphCast are making meteorologists(气象学家) reconsider how we use machine learning and weather forecasts, Peter Dueben, head of Earth system modeling at the European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts(ECMWF), told me for the story.",
